---
import Layout from '../layouts/PersonalLayout.astro';
import { guides } from '../data/guides';
---
<Layout title="Practical AI, automation & systems" description="Practical guides from Jacob, an engineer and small-business owner exploring technology that makes everyday work easier.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">A small corner of the internet, by Jacob</p><h1>Build better systems.<br /><em>Make room for life.</em></h1><p class="lead">Practical ideas about AI, automation and the way we work. From an engineer and small-business owner figuring out what is useful—and what is just more work.</p><p class="small"><a href="/guides/before-you-automate">Start here: before you automate</a>. Choose one repetitive task, preview the change and plan a safe retry.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/guides">Explore the guides <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/resources">See the toolkit</a></div></div>
      <aside class="field-note" aria-label="The approach"><p class="eyebrow">Field notes / 001</p><h2>A little less repetition.<br />A little more intention.</h2><div class="note-row"><span>01</span><p>Start with a real, recurring problem.</p></div><div class="note-row"><span>02</span><p>Build the smallest useful solution.</p></div><div class="note-row"><span>03</span><p>Keep what helps. Simplify the rest.</p></div><p class="note-footer">A working philosophy, not a productivity promise.</p></aside>
    </section>
    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="guides-title"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Start somewhere useful</p><h2 id="guides-title">Small guides. Real questions.</h2></div><p>No daily publishing treadmill. Just a few things worth thinking through.</p></div><div class="cards">{guides.map(guide => <article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">{guide.category}</p><h3><a href={`/guides/${guide.slug}`}>{guide.title}</a></h3><p>{guide.description}</p><a class="read" href={`/guides/${guide.slug}`}>Read the guide <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="small"> · {guide.minutes} min</span></a></article>)}</div></section>
    <section class="section about-strip"><div><p class="eyebrow">The person behind the notes</p><h2>Engineer by trade.<br />Systems thinker by habit.</h2></div><div><p>I'm Jacob. I work in reliability, observability, cloud infrastructure and automation. I'm also a small-business owner, so I care about systems that fit into real life.</p><p>This is a place to share practical approaches, document experiments and leave useful notes for the next person—including future me.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about">A little more about me ↗</a></div></section>
  </div>
</Layout>
